# c optimize records the engines that proved each rewrite into a fixed char[16].
c optimize nofile
```c
int a(int x){ return x<0?-x:x; }
```
c optimize nofile target zen4
```c
int b(int x){ int y=x&255; return y/16; }
```
c optimize nofile target sm75
```c
int c(int x){ return (x*3+1)/2; }
```
c optimize nofile target rdna2
```c
int d(int x){ return x>=0?x:-x; }
```
show 1+1
